	(text "AudioV2 PowerModule — simplified wired (§9 / CIRCUIT_DESIGN §4)\nUSB-C → 50224 CH224 → PD_12V/J_PD → (panel SW) → PD_12V_SW → F1 → DKMW20F-12\n±12V + A_GND → J202 / hier.  LM7809 → VCC_TONE (+9V).  Bench +12V_IN: TBD."
